OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfternoon
OL,6,Fcloud sinking southward leaving some
OL,7,Fevening sunshine for northern and
OL,8,Fwestern areas. A risk of showers,
OL,9,Fpotentially heavy, over East Anglia
OL,10,Finitially, before cloud sinks further
OL,11,Fsouth leaving clear spells for all.
OL,12,FFeeling fresher than of late.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,15,FFriday with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,16,FCloud will turn the sunshine hazy
OL,17,Fthrough the afternoon, before it
OL,18,Fdisperses again later. Fresher than
OL,19,Frecent days.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
